    brief: "<p>A fake socket is given via prop: <code>{ onMessage(cb), close() }</code>. Build <code>Feed({ socket })</code>: it subscribes to <code>onMessage</code> in an effect, prepending each incoming string to a list (newest first), and calls <code>socket.close()</code> on unmount. Render the messages as list items.</p>",
